Hi {Owner},

I build websites for wedding and event venues around {City}. {Business Name} has beautiful weddings on its social pages, but no site where a couple can check their date, see the capacity and book a tour.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: your spaces with [capacity] placeholders, the rain plan, open Friday and Sunday dates, vendor rules and tour booking that asks for the wedding date first, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, open dates and pricing updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes on a quiet weekday?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
